[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛脚步虚浮地踏进一间牢房。<br>那不是她的牢房，是汉娜的牢房。|#0104Adv05_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（汉娜……雪莉……<br>　我好想你们……）|#0104Adv05_Ema001|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:其实艾玛经常会来汉娜的牢房。<br>虽然，可可在房里的时候她会有意识回避。|#0104Adv05_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看着排成一列的那些娃娃，艾玛眼睛都湿了。|#0104Adv05_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她觉得，无论过多久，<br>这个伤痕都不可能完全愈合。|#0104Adv05_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛抱起那个以自己为原型制作的娃娃。|#0104Adv05_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为曾经被火烤过一次，<br>艾玛想着要是一个不小心线头都会散掉，<br>所以一直都是轻拿轻放。|#0104Adv05_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但今天的她实在太过寂寞，不小心用力一抱——|#0104Adv05_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 人形の中で紙がカサリと鳴る音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_66 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:然后，她注意到了一道声音。|#0104Adv05_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（刚才的声音是……）|#0104Adv05_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:娃娃的身体里发出一道<br>类似搓揉纸片的声音。|#0104Adv05_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛看着娃娃，<br>小心翼翼地用手指戳进线头松开的缺口。|#0104Adv05_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她从塞满棉花的娃娃的身体里，<br>摸到一张叠成小小一块的纸片。|#0104Adv05_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:！这是……！|#0104Adv05_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛把娃娃放回原处，<br>然后匆忙摊开了折起来的纸片。|#0104Adv05_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:纸上写着些笔迹潦草的文字。<br>那是雪莉写给艾玛的留言。|#0104Adv05_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

; ＠備考◆涙を呑む

[PrintTextModified Text:……！|#0104Adv05_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看完纸上的留言后，<br>艾玛立刻转身飞奔起来。|#0104Adv05_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

