@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

; ボイス加工：エコー

[PrintTextModified Text:要问那里到底有什么，其实我也不知道怎么回答你才好。|#0104Adv05_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ボイス加工：エコー

[PrintTextModified Text:但我相信，艾玛你一定能够<br>找出真相！|#0104Adv05_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
