@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

; ボイス加工：エコー

[PrintTextModified Text:请你代替我，<br>揭开隐藏在这座诡秘监牢里的真相！|#0104Adv05_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ボイス加工：エコー

[PrintTextModified Text:希望你能答应我！|#0104Adv05_Sherry011| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哈啊、哈啊、哈啊、哈啊……|#0104Adv05_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛用尽全力飞奔，<br>来到了【水精之室】。|#0104Adv05_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她喘着粗气，<br>环视了房间一周。|#0104Adv05_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（应、应该能在这找到些新发现才对，肯定能找到！）|#0104Adv05_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛一边擦着眼里不断掉落的泪水，<br>一边不顾一切地在房间内到处翻找。|#0104Adv05_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（这是雪莉托付给我的情报，<br>　我要找出来，这次我一定要找出来！）|#0104Adv05_Ema007|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

