@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:真的，找到了……|#0104Adv05_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:【在水精之室】内，<br>她发现地板某处有那么一丝丝的缝隙，<br>于是便把地板撬起——然后找到了秘密楼梯。|#0104Adv05_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这里到底是……？）|#0104Adv05_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛愣愣地低头看着那扇明显有意隐藏起来的，<br>通往地下的门。|#0104Adv05_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（进去吧……不管怎样都要先调查看看再说！）|#0104Adv05_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛吞了吞口水，<br>战战兢兢地走下了门后的楼梯。|#0104Adv05_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

