[PrintTextModified Text:楼梯下是一个夹层。<br>那是一个电梯前厅。|#0104Adv05_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:电梯……|#0104Adv05_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（说不定跟外面的世界是相通的！）|#0104Adv05_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Rotation:,,0 Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:31_2

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛怀着一丝的希望，<br>迫不及待地走进了电梯。|#0104Adv05_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_4 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Rotation:,,0 Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:31_1

[PrintTextModified Text:电梯内只有上升和下降两个按钮。<br>艾玛不假思索地按下了下降按钮。|#0104Adv05_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; エレベーター稼働音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Ambi_5_1 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:电梯徐徐下降，<br>艾玛的心跳也随之加速。|#0104Adv05_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（下了电梯后一定，一定就是……！）|#0104Adv05_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopSfx
@Wait WaitMode:0.2

; エレベーター到着音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_68 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

