@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛才走了没多远，<br>就被一扇门挡住了脚步。|#0104Adv05_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:途中并没有任何岔路，<br>看来通道是直通这个房间。|#0104Adv05_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这是什么房间……）|#0104Adv05_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Rotation:,,0 Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:25_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛开门一看，<br>房间里简直就像一家研究所。|#0104Adv05_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:欸……！？|#0104Adv05_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:这完全出乎艾玛的意料，<br>她忍不住发出一声惊叫。|#0104Adv05_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且就在她踏进房间的那一刻，<br>周围的温度一下子就降了下来。|#0104Adv05_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来隔壁房间的温度相当低，<br>把这个房间的室温也连带着拉低了。|#0104Adv05_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛嘴里冒着白烟，在房间内瑟瑟发抖。<br>她感觉站在原地不动的话，<br>不消一会就会冻成冰棍。|#0104Adv05_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（这到底是什么房间……<br>　感觉像是什么研究所）|#0104Adv05_Ema016|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（不、不管了，先调查看看吧！）|#0104Adv05_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她急急忙忙地四处看，<br>然后找到了一份随意放置在架子上的文件。|#0104Adv05_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; ☆証拠品：『囚人名簿ファイル』入手
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛拿起来一打开，<br>发现里面夹着一份囚犯名册。|#0104Adv05_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但上面罗列的姓名艾玛并不熟悉，<br>她想，这应该是记录了过往<br>收监到此处的囚犯少女的名册。|#0104Adv05_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:其中的一个名字让艾玛吃了一惊。<br>那个名字上面还特意画了一个红圈。|#0104Adv05_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——黑部奈叶香。|#0104Adv05_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香……？|#0104Adv05_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛翻到下一页，<br>上面记录的是奈叶香的正面照和个人信息。|#0104Adv05_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:名册里的内容几乎都是用在这座监牢里看到的神秘语言所书写。<br>尽管看不懂，但艾玛推测，<br>这是有关奈叶香的调查报告。|#0104Adv05_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:纸面上好多地方都用艾玛能看懂的语言<br>写了潦草的旁注。|#0104Adv05_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——【重点监视对象】【越狱？】【危险】。|#0104Adv05_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:扑通扑通，艾玛的心剧烈地跳动着。|#0104Adv05_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（奈叶香，究竟是什么人……？）|#0104Adv05_Ema019| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就在下一瞬间。|#0104Adv05_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 施錠音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_4 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛背后的门传来一个令人惊惧的响声。|#0104Adv05_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:！？|#0104Adv05_Ema020| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛仓促地一回头，发现门已经关上了。|#0104Adv05_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她惊恐地四处张望，<br>发现深处有另一扇关得紧紧的门。|#0104Adv05_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛这才意识到，<br>自己是被关起来了。|#0104Adv05_Narrative048| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:欸，怎么办，欸欸！？|#0104Adv05_Ema021| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:完全找不到头绪打开眼前那扇上锁的门，<br>艾玛十分慌张。|#0104Adv05_Narrative049| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:房间内冰冷的温度让她无法<br>正常思考。|#0104Adv05_Narrative050| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:体温在短时间内急速下降，冷得艾玛一身鸡皮疙瘩。<br>接着手指也开始感到麻痹。|#0104Adv05_Narrative051| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这样下去可能会冷死……）|#0104Adv05_Ema022| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:脑海中浮现的想法令艾玛吓得脸色发青。<br>接着，她向一个看似控制面板的仪器跑去。|#0104Adv05_Narrative052| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这个控制面板有点类似于餐馆里的触摸屏，<br>能够从固定用的底座上取下。|#0104Adv05_Narrative053| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:面板上是一个个<br>不知道有什么用处的按钮。|#0104Adv05_Narrative054| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:惊慌失措的艾玛<br>劈里啪啦地逐一按下<br>控制面板上的按钮。|#0104Adv05_Narrative055| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 施錠音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_4 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:在她胡乱按了好几个按钮以后，<br>终于响起门锁打开的声音。|#0104Adv05_Narrative056| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:太好了……！|#0104Adv05_Ema023| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛松了一口气，<br>二话不说马上朝着门外走去。|#0104Adv05_Narrative057| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 操作盤を落とす音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_104 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:就在她把门打开的时候，<br>身后传来了“砰”的一声。|#0104Adv05_Narrative058| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊……！|#0104Adv05_Ema024| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛回过头来，<br>发现控制面板已经掉在地上摔成了两半。|#0104Adv05_Narrative059| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（怎、怎么办……！）|#0104Adv05_Ema025| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看着门外的通道和掉在地上的控制面板，有那么一瞬间，<br>艾玛感到茫然不知所措。|#0104Adv05_Narrative060| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:对……对不起！！|#0104Adv05_Ema026| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:她对着空气道了歉，然后转身离开了。|#0104Adv05_Narrative061| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
