@ModifyBackgroundExtended Rotation:,,0 Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:22_2
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:走出招待所以后，<br>艾玛深深地呼出了一口气。|#0104Adv05_Narrative062| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_22_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:（总算逃出来了……）|#0104Adv05_Ema027| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（也快到就寝时间了，先回监牢吧）|#0104Adv05_Ema028| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛现在依然觉得很混乱。<br>她边走边整理思绪。|#0104Adv05_Narrative063| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（那个地下设施到底是用来做什么的）|#0104Adv05_Ema029| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（从位置上来看……就在监牢的正下方）|#0104Adv05_Ema030| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（另一个让我在意的是——那份文件）|#0104Adv05_Ema031| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:囚犯名册，还有黑部奈叶香的调查报告。<br>这到底意味着什么，当下的艾玛根本无法预测。|#0104Adv05_Narrative064| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她唯一能想到的，<br>就是奈叶香跟其他关在这里的囚犯有着明显的不同。|#0104Adv05_Narrative065| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:"（全都是些想不明白的事情，<br>　但应该还能再去那个地下设施看看）|#0104Adv05_Ema032|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:以防万一，<br>艾玛将【水精之室】恢复了原状。|#0104Adv05_Narrative066| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:（明天再去看看吧）|#0104Adv05_Ema033| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:定下了当前目标后，艾玛稍稍恢复了一些活力，<br>沿着回监牢的路上飞奔。|#0104Adv05_Narrative067| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——此时，一名少女正站在树荫之下，<br>窥视着艾玛的一举一动。|#0104Adv05_Narrative068| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

